OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785595673
OL,3,CHuge outdoor fire breaks out overnight
OL,5,FA huge fire broke out near the edge of
OL,6,Fthe Mendip Hills overnight, with
OL,7,Ffirefighters in attendance this
OL,8,Fmorning (Thursday 30 July).
OL,10,FThe fire began at 10.26pm last night
OL,11,F(Friday 29 July) on Shute Shelve Hill.
OL,13,FThe cause of the fire is currently
OL,14,Funknown.
OL,16,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue
OL,17,Fsaid the fire front was 100 metres by
OL,18,F50 metres.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
