OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785595673
OL,3,CHuge outdoor fire breaks out overnight
OL,5,FA team from Cheddar were initially
OL,6,Fsent to the incident but when they
OL,7,Farrived, a further three fire engines
OL,8,Fand an off road vehicle were requested.
OL,10,FA further two more fire engines and a
OL,11,Fwater carrier were also requested.
OL,13,FThe service said crews used drones,
OL,14,Fbeaters, scotty packs and a wildfire
OL,15,Fpump to extinguish the blaze, and the
OL,16,Fin
OL,18,Fcident involved gorse and brush on a
OL,19,Fsteep hill.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
