OL,3,CHuge outdoor fire breaks out overnight
OL,5,FThe firefighters successfully
OL,6,Fextinguished the blaze and it is no
OL,7,Flonger ongoing.
OL,9,FIt comes as Devon and Somerset's fire
OL,10,Fservice said July has been their
OL,11,Fbusiest month for emergency calls in
OL,12,Fthe last decade.
OL,14,FAcross the month, the service attended
OL,15,F756 fires, averaging 28 fires every
OL,16,Fday compared to the usual daily
OL,17,Faverage of 12.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
