OL,3,CHuge outdoor fire breaks out overnight
OL,5,FThey have also tackled 473 outdoor
OL,6,Ffires, meaning almost two-thirds of
OL,7,Fall fires they've attended this month
OL,8,Fhave been in the open.
OL,10,FDrought declared for many parts of the
OL,11,FWest
OL,13,FMeanwhile, the Environment Agency said
OL,14,Fseven areas of central, eastern and
OL,15,Fsouthern England ` around half of the
OL,16,Fcountry ` have been declared as
OL,17,Fofficially in drought.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
