OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785595673
OL,3,CHuge outdoor fire breaks out overnight
OL,5,FThe areas are East Anglia,
OL,6,FHertfordshire and the whole of London,
OL,7,FThames Valley, Hampshire and the Isle
OL,8,Fof Wight, Devon and Cornwall, the West
OL,9,FMidlands, and Wessex ` covering
OL,10,FDorset, Somerset, Wiltshire and
OL,11,FGloucestershire.
OL,13,FWith a few days left to go, this month
OL,14,Fcould end up as the driest July on
OL,15,Frecord, with England having just 7% of
OL,16,Fexpected rainfall, and southern
OL,17,FEngland seeing just 1%.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
