PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785595673
OL,3,CHuge outdoor fire breaks out overnight
OL,5,FAs a result, much of the country is
OL,6,Fexperiencing a flash drought ` one
OL,7,Fthat has come on quickly despite a
OL,8,Fvery wet winter, as a result of dry
OL,9,Fweather in the spring and summer and a
OL,10,Fseries of heatwaves that put pressure
OL,11,Fon resources.
OL,13,FThe announcement was made as parts of
OL,14,Fthe UK experience their fourth
OL,15,Fheatwave of the summer, with
OL,16,Ftemperatures reaching into the 30s in
OL,17,Fsome places.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
