OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785595673
OL,3,CHuge outdoor fire breaks out overnight
OL,5,FThere were record-breaking heatwaves
OL,6,Fin May and June, and a third earlier
OL,7,Fthis month, which have hit
OL,8,Fagriculture, rivers and the natural
OL,9,Fenvironment, prompted widespread
OL,10,Fwildfires and led to hosepipe bans for
OL,11,Fmillions of people.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
